§§ `s 840 Successive distributions etc by reference to the same accounts`

DECLARE `s 840(2) kind of financial assistance or payment` IS ONE OF
    `s 840(2)(a) financial assistance lawfully given by the company out of its distributable profits`
    `s 840(2)(b) financial assistance given by the company in contravention of section 678 or 679`
    `s 840(2)(c) a payment made by the company in respect of the purchase by it of shares in the company`
    `s 840(2)(d) a payment of any description specified in section 705`
    `s 840(2) another financial assistance or payment`

-- src:11291 | (2) The financial assistance and other payments that are relevant for this purpose are—
-- src:11292 | (a) financial assistance lawfully given by the company out of its distributable profits;
-- src:11293 | (b) financial assistance given by the company in contravention of section 678 or 679 (prohibited financial assistance) in a case where the giving of that assistance reduces the company's net assets or increases its net liabilities;
-- src:11294 | (c) payments made by the company in respect of the purchase by it of shares in the company, except a payment lawfully made otherwise than out of distributable profits;
-- src:11295 | (d) payments of any description specified in section 705 (payments apart from purchase price of shares to be made out of distributable profits).
@ref s 840(2) Successive distributions etc by reference to the same accounts (src:11291-11295)
GIVEN kind IS A `s 840(2) kind of financial assistance or payment`
      `the giving of the assistance reduces the company's net assets or increases its net liabilities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the payment was lawfully made otherwise than out of distributable profits` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 705 the payment is of a description specified in section 705 (payments apart from purchase price of shares to be made out of distributable profits)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 840(2) the financial assistance or payment is relevant for the purposes of subsection (1)` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `s 840(2)(a) financial assistance lawfully given by the company out of its distributable profits` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 840(2)(b) financial assistance given by the company in contravention of section 678 or 679` THEN
        IF `the giving of the assistance reduces the company's net assets or increases its net liabilities`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "financial assistance given by the company in contravention of section 678 or 679 (prohibited financial assistance) in a case where the giving of that assistance reduces the company's net assets or increases its net liabilities" ("in a case where" fails)
    WHEN `s 840(2)(c) a payment made by the company in respect of the purchase by it of shares in the company` THEN
        IF `the payment was lawfully made otherwise than out of distributable profits`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "except a payment lawfully made otherwise than out of distributable profits"
        ELSE JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 840(2)(d) a payment of any description specified in section 705` THEN
        CONSIDER `s 705 the payment is of a description specified in section 705 (payments apart from purchase price of shares to be made out of distributable profits)`
        WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "payments of any description specified in section 705": the descriptions are in s 705 (outside this Part)
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): subsection (2) names four kinds; it does not say "only" (it says "are")

-- src:11287 | (1) In determining whether a proposed distribution may be made by a company in a case where—
-- src:11288 | (a) one or more previous distributions have been made in pursuance of a determination made by reference to the same relevant accounts, or
-- src:11289 | (b) relevant financial assistance has been given, or other relevant payments have been made, since those accounts were prepared,
-- src:11290 | the provisions of this Part apply as if the amount of the proposed distribution was increased by the amount of the previous distributions, financial assistance and other payments.
@ref s 840(1) Successive distributions etc by reference to the same accounts (src:11287-11290)
GIVEN `the amount of the proposed distribution` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount of previous distributions made in pursuance of a determination made by reference to the same relevant accounts` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount of the relevant financial assistance given, and other relevant payments made, since those accounts were prepared` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 840(1) the amount of the proposed distribution as increased for the purposes of this Part` MEANS
    `the amount of the proposed distribution` PLUS `the amount of previous distributions made in pursuance of a determination made by reference to the same relevant accounts` PLUS `the amount of the relevant financial assistance given, and other relevant payments made, since those accounts were prepared`

-- src:11296 | (3) In this section “financial assistance” has the same meaning as in Chapter 2 of Part 18 (see section 677).
@ref s 840(3) Successive distributions etc by reference to the same accounts (src:11296-11296)
GIVEN `s 677 the assistance is financial assistance within the meaning of Chapter 2 of Part 18` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 840(3) the assistance is financial assistance for the purposes of this section` MEANS
    `s 677 the assistance is financial assistance within the meaning of Chapter 2 of Part 18` -- "has the same meaning as in Chapter 2 of Part 18 (see section 677)": the borrowed answer, supplied by the caller; NOTHING stays NOTHING (points outside the text)

-- src:11297 | (4) For the purpose of applying subsection (2)(b) in relation to any financial assistance—
-- src:11298 | (a) “net assets” means the amount by which the aggregate amount of the company's assets exceeds the aggregate amount of its liabilities, and
-- src:11299 | (b) “net liabilities” means the amount by which the aggregate amount of the company's liabilities exceeds the aggregate amount of its assets,
-- src:11300 | taking the amount of the assets and liabilities to be as stated in the company's accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given.
@ref s 840(4) Successive distributions etc by reference to the same accounts (src:11297-11300)
GIVEN `the aggregate amount of the company's assets as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given` IS A NUMBER
      `the aggregate amount of its liabilities as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 840(4)(a) the company's net assets` MEANS
    IF `the aggregate amount of the company's assets as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given` GREATER THAN `the aggregate amount of its liabilities as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given`
    THEN `the aggregate amount of the company's assets as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given` MINUS `the aggregate amount of its liabilities as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given`
    ELSE 0

@ref s 840(4)(b) Successive distributions etc by reference to the same accounts (src:11299-11299)
GIVEN `the aggregate amount of the company's assets as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given` IS A NUMBER
      `the aggregate amount of its liabilities as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 840(4)(b) the company's net liabilities` MEANS
    IF `the aggregate amount of its liabilities as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given` GREATER THAN `the aggregate amount of the company's assets as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given`
    THEN `the aggregate amount of its liabilities as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given` MINUS `the aggregate amount of the company's assets as stated in its accounting records immediately before the financial assistance is given`
    ELSE 0

-- src:11301 | (5) For this purpose a company's liabilities include any amount retained as reasonably necessary for the purposes of providing for any liability—
-- src:11302 | (a) the nature of which is clearly defined, and
-- src:11303 | (b) which is either likely to be incurred or certain to be incurred but uncertain as to amount or as to the date on which it will arise.
@ref s 840(5) Successive distributions etc by reference to the same accounts (src:11301-11303)
GIVEN `the amount is retained as reasonably necessary for the purposes of providing for a liability` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the nature of the liability is clearly defined` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the liability is either likely to be incurred or certain to be incurred but uncertain as to amount or as to the date on which it will arise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 840(5) the amount retained is included in the company's liabilities` MEANS
    IF     `the amount is retained as reasonably necessary for the purposes of providing for a liability`
       AND `the nature of the liability is clearly defined`
       AND `the liability is either likely to be incurred or certain to be incurred but uncertain as to amount or as to the date on which it will arise`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "a company's liabilities include any amount retained as reasonably necessary for the purposes of providing for any liability— (a) the nature of which is clearly defined, and (b) which is either likely to be incurred or certain to be incurred but uncertain as to amount or as to the date on which it will arise" does not close the list
